WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:11.200
Every business that runs ads has the same problem. Leads come in faster than anyone can reply.

2
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:19.408
PROXe is your AI front desk for leads. It answers, it scores, it books. Around the clock.

3
00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:28.504
This is your business at a glance. Conversations, hot leads, bookings. All live.

4
00:00:28.554 --> 00:00:36.922
Every lead from WhatsApp, your website, calls and Instagram, in one list. Ranked by who's ready to buy.

5
00:00:36.972 --> 00:00:48.911
Open one and the story is already written. What they want, and why they scored ninety.

6
00:00:48.961 --> 00:00:56.007
Every conversation lives here. PROXe replies in seconds, with buttons that move people forward.

7
00:00:56.057 --> 00:01:01.902
And when someone books, it lands on your calendar. Reminders and all.

8
00:01:01.952 --> 00:01:03.677
You run the business. PROXe runs the follow-up.
